- The current prior objective is weighted cosine loss plus Huber loss plus a CLIP-style prior alignment loss; the commented MSE is not active.
- The current full-test metric set includes image metrics such as pixcorr, SSIM, AlexNet, Inception, CLIP, EfficientNet, and SwAV. The first smoke run should use a small explicit subset if optional models make the full set impractical.

