Analysis addendum after failure audit:
- The immediate failure is caused by `test_low_level.py` composing baseline `train_low_level`, which sets `use_perceptual_loss=false`; the checkpoint contains 150 `perceptual_loss.*` tensors from the trained unaligned SynCLR model.
